---
description: >-
  A comma inside a style value (#1312, D706): rgb() and hsl() colours and a font-family list
  are kept whole, also when two values or two classDefs share pieces (D and E). v12 dropped
  the pieces after each comma.
---
classDiagram
  class A
  class B
  class C
  class D
  class E
  A --> B
  B --> C
  C --> D
  D --> E
  style A fill:rgb(255, 200, 200)
  style B stroke:hsl(210, 60%, 40%),stroke-width:3px
  classDef serif color:#333,font-family:Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif
  cssClass "C" serif
  classDef red fill:rgb(255, 0, 0),stroke:rgb(0, 0, 0)
  cssClass "D" red
  classDef blue stroke:rgb(10, 0, 0)
  classDef pink fill:rgb(255, 0, 0)
  cssClass "E" blue
  cssClass "E" pink
